# Session Rules

Two fully separate session types — they never overlap.

| | Admin | Portal |
|-|-------|--------|
| Contains | `userId + accountId + role` | `contactId + accountId` |
| Accesses | `/admin/*` only | `/portal/*` only |
| Cookie | `v_admin_session` | `v_portal_session` |
| Validator | `requireAdminSession()` | `requirePortalSession()` |

```ts
// ✅ Admin route
const session = await requireAdminSession()

// ✅ Portal route
const session = await requirePortalSession()
```

- If `session.accountId !== resolved accountId` from middleware: **reject immediately**.
- No shared session store, no shared cookies between admin and portal.
